# Principals whose signature counts as release-grade machine evidence.
#
# Public-release evidence must be signed by one of these. A principal that is
# pinned in `docs/trusted-signers.allowed` but absent here may still sign
# host-drill evidence, but it cannot satisfy the public gate: it records an
# operator's shell signing a file, not a CI run on an exact tagged commit.
#
# An empty or comment-only file means nothing is release-grade (fail closed), so
# a missing list blocks a public verdict instead of silently accepting any pinned
# signer.
#
# Format: one principal per line, matching the first column of
# `docs/trusted-signers.allowed`.

arven-release-tooling-ci
